# Phase identity: cxr-mc crystal catalog entry [mote2].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# 2H-MoTe2 (alpha-MoTe2, semiconducting; P6_3/mmc) -- isostructural with MoSe2:
# Mo on Wyckoff 2c (1/3,2/3,1/4), Te on 4f with z = 0.621 (delta = |0.75 - 0.621|
# = 0.129 from its Mo plane). Bulk lattice a = 3.517, c = 13.96 A (literature/Materials
# Project). The Mo-Te bond sqrt((a/sqrt(3))^2 + (0.129 c)^2) = 2.73 A.
# Validation: mote2-bulk-structure
